l=\"nofollow ugc\">Point V3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/widgets/point#point-v4\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Point V4</a></li>\n</ol>\n<h4>SportsPress</h4>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/widgets/player-card#player-card-v1\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Player Card V1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/widgets/player-card#player-card-v2\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Player Card V2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/widgets/player-card#player-card-v3\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Player Card V3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/widgets/player-card#player-card-v4\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Player Card V4</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/widgets/score#score-v1\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Score V1</a> &#8211; <strong>NEW!</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/widgets/score#score-v2\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Score V2</a> &#8211; <strong>NEW!</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/widgets/score#score-v3\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Score V3</a> &#8211; <strong>NEW!</strong></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/widgets/score#score-v4\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Score V4</a> &#8211; <strong>NEW!</strong></li>\n</ol>\n<h4>WooCommerce</h4>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/widgets/product-card#product-card-v1\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Product Card V1</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/widgets/product-card#product-card-v2\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Product Card V2</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/widgets/product-card#product-card-v3\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Product Card V3</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/widgets/product-card#product-card-v4\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Product Card V4</a></li>\n</ol>\n<h3>Feedback</h3>\n<p><strong>We care a lot about your opinion!</strong>, please let us know what you think of the widgets and what would you like to see added in the future!.</p>\n<h3>Reviews</h3>\n<p>Being a new plugin, we would really appreciate it if you could leave a review. If you like the plugin, help us by leaving a 5* rating. This will allow us to reach more people and keep working on improving the plugin and adding more and more widgets! Thanks a lot!</p>\n",
        "installation": "<p>To install the plugin, go to your WordPress dashboard and follow these steps:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Go to <strong>Plugins &gt; Add Plugin</strong></li>\n<li>Click on the <strong>Upload Plugin</strong> button at the top left side of the page</li>\n<li>Click <strong>Browse&#8230;</strong>, go to the folder where you have the plugin <strong>.zip file</strong> stored and select it</li>\n<li>Click on <strong>Install Now</strong> to install it</li>\n<li>After it installs, click on the <strong>Activate Plugin</strong> button to finish</li>\n</ul>\n<p>We highly recommend following our documentation more detailed <a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/documentation/install-and-setup\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">installation and setup instructions</a>.</p>\n",
        "faq": "\n<dt id=\"what%20do%20i%20need%20to%20be%20able%20to%20use%20the%20plugin%3F\">\nWhat do i need to be able to use the plugin?\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>The plugin requires a <strong>WordPress</strong> installation and the <strong>Elementor</strong> plugin to be installed and active. Each widget may require additional plugins to be installed, please check the respective widget <a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/documentation\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">documentation</a> for a full list of requirements.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"the%20widget%20is%20not%20displaying%20on%20the%20page\">\nThe widget is not displaying on the page\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Please make sure that you haven&#8217;t disabled the widget from the plugin options, take a look at <a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/documentation/features#widgets\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">how the plugin Widget page works</a> in our documentation for more details.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"the%20widget%20is%20missing%20some%20information\">\nThe widget is missing some information\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Some widgets take the information they display from other plugins, so you need to make sure that you have entered the necessary information via the respective plugin dashboard interface. For example, the <a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/documentation/achievement\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">Achivevement widget</a> requires the <strong>GamiPress</strong> plugin and an achievement to have been previously created to be able to display its information. Please check the respective widget <a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/documentation\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">documentation</a> for a full list of requirements.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"i%20need%20help%20installing%20the%20plugin\">\nI need help installing the plugin\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>Please follow our documentation <a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/documentation/install-and-setup\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">install and setup guide</a> for a detailed step by step guide on how to install the plugin.</p>\n</p>\n<dt id=\"i%20need%20help%20with%20a%20widget\">\nI need help with a widget\n</h4>\n<p>\n<p>We have a documentation page available for each widget the plugin includes, please open our <a href=\"https://orokublocks.com/documentation\" rel=\"nofollow ugc\">documentation</a> and search for the specific widget you need help with from the left sidebar menu.</p>\n</p>\n\n",
        "changelog": "<h4>1.1.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>New Widgets</strong>: Added 4 new Score widgets that allow the display of SportsPress event information such as date, league, season, teams and results.</li>\n</ul>\n<h4>1.0.0</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Release version with 13 free widgets and 40+ total in the pro version.</li>\n</ul>\n"
